@startuml
!include common.iuml
title Sequence 1 - Submit complaint (UC-01, FR-001 to FR-004, FR-007, FR-012)
autonumber
actor Citizen
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "complaint_routes\nPOST /submit-complaint" as R
participant "Auth/RBAC" as A
participant "Storage LOCK" as L
participant "Schema" as V
participant "Categoriser" as N
participant "Ticket ID" as T
participant "Routing" as RT
participant "SLA" as S
participant "Audit log" as AU
participant "Notifications" as NO
Citizen -> UI : fill title, description,\nseverity, images, GPS
UI -> R : multipart form + Bearer JWT
R -> A : roles_required("citizen")
alt token missing / invalid / wrong role
  A --> UI : 401 / 403 {error}
end
R -> L : acquire (re-entrant lock)
R -> V : validate(form, images)
alt validation fails
  V --> R : errors
  R --> UI : 400 {error, fields}
end
R -> N : suggest_categories(title + description)
N --> R : top-3 with confidence
note right of R : citizen's category wins;\nelse top suggestion
R -> T : generate_ticket_id(existing IDs)
T --> R : SCMS-YYYYMMDD-NNNNN
R -> RT : route(category, users, zone)
RT --> R : department, least-loaded agent\n(or needs_supervisor)
R -> S : assign_deadline()\n(category override or severity default)
R -> L : write_json (temp file + os.replace)
R -> AU : record("complaint_submitted")
R -> NO : complaint_submitted()
NO -> NO : in-app + email/SMS per prefs\n(failure logged, not raised)
R -> L : release
note over R, NO : The lock is held for the whole request, so a slow\nSMTP/SMS provider delays other writes (known limitation).
R --> UI : 201 complaint JSON
UI --> Citizen : ticket ID + category
@enduml
